<title>JAPAN: Takasago Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takasago Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.20		vs	    3.31</p>
<p> Operating	  205    million    vs	  175    million</p>
<p> Current	    171    million    vs	  187    million</p>
<p> Net		  125    million    vs	  135    million</p>
<p> EPS		   21.57 yen	  vs	   24.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.25 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Takasago Electric Industry Co Ltd is a maker of pachinko and slot machines.</p>
